      "content": "i already tried talking to my manager about it and they just brushed me off like it's no big deal. it felt really suspicious, like they already know something i don't. i don't want to make a huge scene and risk my job though. can you just give me some practical ways to hide my vitals while i'm sitting in it? like, are there specific types of clothing or even sitting positions that would mess with the sensors' ability to pick up a steady signal?",
